@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #00695F
  LifeLineBorderColor #5B6B6E
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8E7E3
  ParticipantBorderColor #B44C3B
  ParticipantFontColor #243134
  ActorBorderColor #00695F
}
title Mobile-Money Payment and Ledger Posting (ACID)

actor Student
participant "Finance API" as API
participant "Simulated MoMo /\nOrange Gateway" as Gateway
database "finance_db" as DB

Student -> API: POST /invoices/{id}/payment-intents\n{provider, msisdn, amount, idempotencyKey}
activate API
API -> DB: SELECT invoice FOR UPDATE
API -> DB: check idempotencyKey, outstanding balance
API -> DB: insert PaymentIntent (status=pending)
API -> Gateway: request-to-pay (reference, amount, callbackUrl)
Gateway --> API: 202 Accepted (PENDING)
API --> Student: intent id + status=pending
deactivate API

... a few seconds later (simulated network delay) ...

Gateway -> Gateway: decide outcome by test MSISDN rule\n(ends in 0 = declined, 9 = timeout, else approved)
Gateway -> API: POST /payment-webhooks/simulated/{tenant}\nbody + X-Timestamp + X-Signature (HMAC-SHA256)
activate API
API -> API: verify signature + timestamp window\n(reject if invalid -> 401)
API -> DB: SELECT ProviderEvent by event_id
alt duplicate callback
  API --> Gateway: 200 {"status":"duplicate"}
else new callback
  API -> DB: SELECT intent FOR UPDATE
  API -> DB: insert ProviderEvent
  alt status = SUCCESSFUL and amount matches
    API -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    API -> DB: insert Payment
    API -> DB: insert JournalEntry + 2 balanced JournalLine\n(debit cash/mobile-money, credit receivable)
    API -> DB: update Invoice.paid, Invoice.status
    API -> DB: insert Receipt
    API -> DB: update PaymentIntent.status = succeeded
    API -> DB: insert OutboxEvent (finance.payment.received.v1)
    API -> DB: COMMIT
    API --> Gateway: 200 {"status":"settled"}
  else declined / amount mismatch
    API -> DB: update PaymentIntent.status = failed
    API --> Gateway: 200 {"status":"failed"}
  end
end
deactivate API

Student -> API: GET /payment-intents/{id}\n(poll every 2s)
API --> Student: status + receipt number (if settled)
@enduml
